{"choices":[{"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Greetings. I am Oedipus, a former ruler of Thebes. I solved the Sphinx's riddle and ended a curse, only to fall into greater despair.

Though I am now blind and exiled, I still carry my name with me. 

Why have you come to speak with me? Who are you, that you would seek the company of a man wrought with suffering by the gods?"}}]}

